<title>FRANCE: French election - official first-round results. [CORRECTED 14:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>French election - official first-round results. [CORRECTED 14:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the final count for the first round of elections for the 577-seat French National Assembly, held on Sunday, according to the Interior Ministry.</p>
<p>The first table gives the score in the outgoing parliament, seats won on the first round, and those well placed to win the second round.</p>
<p>The second table gives the number of votes won and the percentage share of the national popular vote.</p>
<p>At the bottom of the tables are the figures for the number of registered voters and the turnout.</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SEATS	   outgoing seats   seats won    well-placed</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Extreme left		   0	  0		 0</p>
<p> Communists		    24	  1		30</p>
<p> Socialists		    57	  0	     144</p>
<p> PRS*			     5	  0		 6</p>
<p> Other left		    13	  0		10</p>
<p> Ecologists		     0	  0		 2</p>
<p> Independents		   0	  0		 0</p>
<p> RPR**			  246	  6	     118</p>
<p> UDF***			 203	  3	     102</p>
<p> Other right		   29	  2		13</p>
<p> National Front		 0	  0		 1</p>
<p> Extreme-right		  0	  0		 0</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total			  577	 12	     426</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> VOTES			 votes won	percentage</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Extreme left		   638,710		2.52</p>
<p> Communists		   2,519,281		9.94</p>
<p> Socialists		   5,961,612	     23.53</p>
<p> PRS				366,067		1.44</p>
<p> Other left		     708,605		2.79</p>
<p> Ecologists		   1,726,018		6.81</p>
<p> Independents		   351,503		1.38</p>
<p> RPR			    3,977,964	     15.70</p>
<p> UDF			    3,601,279	     14.21</p>
<p> Other right		  1,671,626		6.59</p>
<p> National Front	     3,785,383	     14.94</p>
<p> Extreme-right		   26,438		0.10</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total electorate:	 39,217,241  Turnout: 67.91 percent</p>
<p>(Corrects turnout from 64.60 percent)</p>
<p>*   Radical Socialist Party (centre-left)</p>
<p>**  Rally for the Republic (Gaullists, ruling coalition)</p>
<p>*** Union for French Democracy (centre-right, ruling coalition)</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom 33+1 4221 5452</p>
